ACCEPTABLE USE (binding condition of use)

This project is a diagnostics, QA, and authorized-automation tool. By using it
you agree that you will:

  * Operate it only against systems you own or are explicitly authorized to
    test (including the bundled mock-extranet), and only in a manner permitted
    by the target system's Terms of Service and applicable law.
  * Use recording only on your own authenticated sessions.
  * NOT use it to evade, disable, spoof, or bypass any security control,
    bot-detection, rate limit, CAPTCHA, or access restriction of any system.

The project deliberately omits and refuses to implement anti-detection,
fingerprint-spoofing, IP-rotation, CAPTCHA-bypass, bot-detection-bypass, and
fake-user-behavior capabilities. See docs/07-safety-modes.md.
